# UI and Form Patterns

## Layout
- Edit pages: two-column on desktop (form left, preview right sticky).
- Mobile: preview collapses behind toggle button above form.
- Use shadcn Card/CardHeader/CardTitle for form sections.

## Forms
- Group related fields in a single Card (e.g. couple info, ceremony, theme).
- Use `grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2` for field pairs.
- Labels: `text-sm font-medium text-gray-700`, inputs use shadcn `Input`.
- Color pickers: native `<input type="color">` + hex Input side by side.
- Section order: reorder list with ChevronUp/ChevronDown buttons.

## Image Slots
- Structure slots (hero, countdown, wedding, quote): defined in `lib/wedding-image-slots.ts`.
- Album slots (gallery grid): start at index 6 in `wedding.gallery`.
- Each slot card shows: label, hint text, thumbnail preview, upload button.
- Clicking a slot in the form highlights the corresponding area in the preview panel.
- Clicking an image area in the preview panel selects the slot in the form.

## Template Components
- Use `EditOverlayContext` to pass edit mode into template tree.
- `editSlotClass()` adds ring highlight + cursor-pointer when in edit mode.
- `data-wedding-slot` attribute on clickable image containers.
- `ImageWithFallback` for all user-uploaded images (graceful fallback on error).

## Toast and Feedback
- Use `useToast()` from `hooks/use-toast` for success/error messages.
- Show `Loader2` spinner on async buttons while loading.
- Disable submit when required fields are empty.